/*  EXPECTED: COMPILES and runs; compiled output must match the interpreter.

    A named function that stores into its argument, handed to another function with the container declared in the same rabbit.

    Nothing here outlives its region, and nothing is refused: the store is judged where the
    function is cast or handed over (docs/SOUNDNESS.md, obligation O4). */

Bind void to push-into, given (the series of series of number bag):
    Define fresh as a series of number with (1, 2, 3).
    Insert fresh into bag.
Done.
Bind void to run-it, given (the void function work given (the series of series of number), the series of series of number bag):
    Cast work on (bag).
Done.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define keeper as a series of series of number.
    Cast run-it on (push-into, keeper).
    State keeper.
Done.
